        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bowmanville",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Darlington Nuclear Generating Station, opened in 1974, remains Bowmanville’s largest employer.",
